<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Hello {{.Data.name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">{{with index .Data "kind"}}{{if eq . "renewal_reminder"}}Your Koro student verification ends in {{index $.Data "days_left"}} days. Without a renewal the student features close and companies no longer discover you.{{else if eq . "document_approved"}}Your student document was approved; your student verification lasts one year.{{else if eq . "document_rejected"}}Your student document was not approved. You can see the reason in the app and upload a new document.{{else if eq . "lapsed"}}Your Koro student verification has ended. The student features are closed and companies no longer discover you; you can verify again at any time.{{else}}Your Koro student verification changed.{{end}}{{end}}</p>
<p style="margin:0;"><a href="{{index .Data "link"}}" style="color:#1d4ed8;">My student verification</a></p>
